OL,3,GNEWSADerry 'can challenge' Belfast in  
OL,4,Aattracting major film and TV           
OL,5,Aproductions                            
OL,7,FActors, camera crews and location signs
OL,8,Ffixed on lampposts have become         
OL,9,Fcommonplace in Belfast as it becomes a 
OL,10,Fhub for film and TV productions.       
OL,12,FBut a new screen initiative has been   
OL,13,Flaunched in Londonderry to try to tempt
OL,14,Fsome of that business to the north     
OL,15,Fwest.                                  
OL,17,FDerry Screen aims to help the north    
OL,18,Fwest compete with Belfast for a greater
OL,19,Fshare of Northern Ireland's lucrative  
OL,20,Fscreen production industry.            
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
