OL,3,GNEWSADerry 'can challenge' Belfast in  
OL,4,Aattracting major film and TV           
OL,5,Aproductions                            
OL,7,FOrlaith Meenan said the north west "has
OL,8,Ftalent in abundance", along with       
OL,9,F"beautiful beaches, rugged coastlines, 
OL,10,Fa vibrant and historical city right on 
OL,11,Four doorstep that could host any number
OL,12,Fof productions".                       
